  "meaning": "A seven-position precision register holds independent removable inserts: a pattern cassette, token comb, engraved document, letterform tile, catalog leaves, branch gate, and preview aperture. Keyed sockets, flush hex fasteners, small locating pins, replaceable feet, and a copper registration slide make the fixture mechanically explicit. The inserts are independent tools, not a processing chain. Detailed machined construction, actual recessed marks, separate fasteners, brushed polished steel, warm oxide copper, graphite interiors, directional softbox reflections, and genuine transparent negative space.",
